This software is an unofficial integration with Pandora. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Pandora Media, LLC.
"Pandora" is a trademark of its respective owner. All music, station,
and related content belong to their respective owners.

It authenticates against Pandora's unofficial JSON API using the
well-known Android partner credentials that are public knowledge and
shared by all unofficial Pandora clients (the same keys used by pydora
and similar projects). These credentials are reverse-engineered from
the official client and are not issued to this project. Using this
integration may violate Pandora's Terms of Service. Use it at your own
risk and only with an account you own.
